                            "last_played": 1524265938
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I've had the opportunity to play this with a couple guys and I have to say, this is a really enjoyable game! I do like the pvp nature of it while playing as a tyre in numerous different gamemodes. Things can also definitly get heated in competitive gameplay, making this a good party game to pass the time at different meetings and get togethers.\n\nThe only thing I would really put against this is that there needs to be more single player action. A player vs bots mode would be appreciated as it does then give us the ability to play on our own when away from our friends (a bit of practise hurts nobody eh? :P )\n\nI do wish you guys the best of luck and I cannot wait to see where development goes in the future!",
